On the film aggregator website , Rotten Tomatoes , the overall rating of the film is a `` fresh '' 79 % from 28 critical reviews with an average rating of 6.4 / 10 . Its consensus states that `` A good introduction to Lewis Carroll 's classic , Alice in Wonderland boasts some of the Disney canon 's most surreal and twisted images . '' The film was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Scoring of a Musical Picture , but lost to An American in Paris . Soundtrack ( edit ) The film soundtrack was first released on LP record on July 28 , 1951 . The soundtrack was re-released on Audio CD by Walt Disney Records on February 3 , 1998. ; Songs in the film `` Alice in Wonderland '' -- The Jud Conlon Chorus and The Mellomen `` In a World of My Own '' -- Alice `` I 'm Late '' -- White Rabbit `` The Sailor 's Hornpipe '' -- Dodo `` The Caucus Race '' -- Dodo and Animals `` How Do You Do and Shake Hands ? ''","entities":["Alice in Wonderland","The Mellomen","Alice","In a World of My Own","Academy Award for Best Scoring of a Musical Picture","An American in Paris","I'm Late","The Sailor's Hornpipe","How Do You Do and Shake Hands?","Dodo","The Jud Conlon Chorus","The Caucus Race","White Rabbit","Walt Disney Records","soundtrack"],"facts":["Alice in Wonderland -RELATED_TO-> head film","Alice in Wonderland -RELATED_TO-> jazz standard","Alice in Wonderland -RELATED_TO-> Alice in Wonderland premiere","Alice in Wonderland -RELATED_TO-> Alice books","Alice in Wonderland -RELATED_TO-> theatrical re-release of Alice in Wonderland"]}
