In the bottom of the inning , Yasiel Puig hit a home run off of Ken Giles and Enrique Hernández drove in Logan Forsythe to tie the game , with the latter being the Dodgers ' first run that was not driven in by a home run . In the next inning , George Springer hit a two - run home run for the Astros off of Brandon McCarthy to retake the lead . In the bottom of the 11th inning , Charlie Culberson homered off of Chris Devenski , who later struck out Puig to end the game . This was the first ever World Series game in which a team hit home runs in the ninth , tenth and eleventh inning . The teams set a new record for combined home runs in a single World Series game with eight and this was the first time in MLB history , regular season or postseason , that five home runs were hit in extra innings . The Astros won their first World Series game in franchise history as they had been swept in their previous appearance in 2005 . Game 3 ( edit ) Lance McCullers Jr. earned the win in Game 3 .","entities":["George Springer","Dodgers","Charlie Culberson","World Series game","Yasiel Puig","Ken Giles","Enrique Hernández","Logan Forsythe","Brandon McCarthy","Chris Devenski","Game 3","2017 World Series","Lance McCullers Jr.","Astros","2005 World Series"],"facts":["George Springer -RELATED_TO-> World Series Most Valuable Player","George Springer -RELATED_TO-> World Series MVP","Springer swats his way to MVP honors -RELATED_TO-> George Springer","George Springer wins World Series MVP, ties record with five homers -RELATED_TO-> George Springer","George Springer -PARTICIPATED_IN-> Game 2"]}
