[Ebcefac] {"title":"Harper Valley PTA (film)","text":"Harper Valley PTA (film)
The film starred Barbara Eden , Nanette Fabray , Ronny Cox , Louis Nye and Susan Swift , directed by Richard Bennett , and was mainly released to drive - in theaters throughout the summer of 1978 . The film has a cult following in fans of the original song . The film 's promotional tagline is : `` The song was scandalous . The movie is hilarious ! '' Contents ( hide ) 1 Plot 2 Cast and characters 3 Production and release 3.1 Filming 3.2 Release 4 Soundtrack 5 Television series 6 References 7 External links Plot ( edit ) Stella Johnson is a beautiful widowed single mother who lives in the town of Harper Valley , Ohio . She sells cosmetics door - to - door for the fictitious AngelGlo Cosmetics and is not afraid to enjoy life . Her fourteen - year - old daughter , Dee , is a student at Harper Valley Junior High School . After leaving school , Dee brings her mother a letter from the school 's Parent Teacher Association board , which is led by the pompous and snobbish Flora Simpson - Reilly .","entities":["Harper Valley PTA","Ronny Cox","Louis Nye","Susan Swift","Dee","Harper Valley, Ohio","AngelGlo Cosmetics","Harper Valley Junior High School","Parent Teacher Association","Stella Johnson","Flora Simpson-Reilly","Nanette Fabray","Barbara Eden","Richard Bennett"],"facts":["Harper Valley PTA -LOCATED_IN-> Ohio","Harper Valley PTA -LOCATED_IN-> Lebanon","Harper Valley PTA -LOCATED_IN-> Simi Valley High School","Harper Valley PTA -LOCATED_IN-> Hancock Park","Harper Valley PTA -LOCATED_IN-> United States"]}
