`` The Sword of the Holy Knight '' `` Seikishi no Ken '' ( 聖 騎士 の 剣 ) October 12 , 2014 Holy Knight Gilthunder plants his sword in the center of a town named the Bernia Village , thus preventing the town from making the Bernia Ale , the primary source of income . After innumerable unsuccessful attempts by the villagers to remove the sword , which blocked the water source , Meliodas easily removes the object . A celebration is held at the Boar Hat , and Meliodas is hailed as a savior of the Bernia Village . Gilthunder , wanting to confirm whether the removal of his sword was an accident or not , throws a spear imbued with his power towards the town . However , Meliodas easily stops and throws the spear back , destroying Fort Solgales . Meliodas , Elizabeth and Hawk decide to proceed to the Forest of White Dreams .","entities":["The Sword of the Holy Knight","Bernia Village","Fort Solgales","Bernia Ale","sword","spear","water source","Hawk","Forest of White Dreams","Gilthunder","Meliodas","Boar Hat","celebration","Elizabeth"],"facts":["Hawk -LOCATED_IN-> Baste Dungeon","Hawk -LOCATED_IN-> village","Emma -RELATED_TO-> sword","Gideon -RELATED_TO-> sword","Hawk -LOCATED_IN-> dungeon"]}
