Casting ( edit ) Bruce Willis returned as John McClane , and has expressed a desire to shoot A Good Day to Die Hard and a sixth installment in the series before retiring the character . When casting the role of Jack McClane , the studios considered several actors , including Liam Hemsworth and James Badge Dale , before ultimately settling on Australian actor Jai Courtney . Mary Elizabeth Winstead also appeared in the film , reprising her role as McClane 's daughter Lucy . However all her scenes were cut from the Extended release . Sebastian Koch played the film 's primary antagonist , Yuri Komarov , while Yuliya Snigir and Cole Hauser featured as secondary characters Irina and Collins . The cast was completed by actors Amaury Nolasco as a friend of McClane , Pasha D. Lychnikoff as a taxi driver , and Megalyn Echikunwoke , Anne Vyalitsyna , and Ivan Kamaras in smaller roles . Filming ( edit ) Production began in Hungary in April 2012 , with the capital Budapest standing in for Moscow .","entities":["Collins","A Good Day to Die Hard","Yuri Komarov","Jack McClane","John McClane","Irina","Jai Courtney","Sebastian Koch","Yuliya Snigir","Cole Hauser","Amaury Nolasco","Liam Hemsworth","James Badge Dale","Mary Elizabeth Winstead","Pasha D. Lychnikoff"],"facts":["Collins -RELATED_TO-> Atlanta Falcons","Collins -RELATED_TO-> Boredom","Collins -RELATED_TO-> Komarov","Collins -RELATED_TO-> Jack","Collins -RELATED_TO-> Face Value"]}
