Komarov remarks that Jack will get to watch his father die , prompting Jack to hurl him off the rooftop into the path of the spinning helicopter rotors , killing him . As Jack and John reunite inside the building , Irina tries to avenge her father by ramming the helicopter , now out of ammunition , into the building in a suicide attack . Father and son survive by leaping off the building into a large pool of water , as the helicopter crashes and explodes , killing Irina . In the end , the McClanes return home and reunite with Lucy on the tarmac . Cast ( edit ) Bruce Willis as John McClane Jai Courtney as John `` Jack '' McClane , Jr . Sebastian Koch as Yuri Komarov Yuliya Snigir as Irina Komarova Sergei Kolesnikov as Viktor Chagarin Radivoje Bukvić as Alik Mary Elizabeth Winstead as Lucy McClane Additional cast members include CIA operatives : Aldis Hodge as Lt. Foxy and Cole Hauser as Mike Collins . Amaury Nolasco appears as Murphy , an NYPD detective and McClane 's friend .","entities":["NYPD","A Good Day to Die Hard","Viktor Chagarin","Yuri Komarov","John McClane","Lucy McClane","Alik","Jai Courtney","Jack McClane, Jr.","Sebastian Koch","Yuliya Snigir","Irina Komarova","Sergei Kolesnikov","Radivoje Bukvić","Aldis Hodge"],"facts":["NYPD -RELATED_TO-> Javier Rojas","NYPD -RELATED_TO-> NYPD ceremony for the son's promotion to detective and Gormley's promotion to Lieutenant","Reverend Potter -RELATED_TO-> NYPD","NYPD-FDNY charity boxing match -RELATED_TO-> NYPD","NYPD -LOCATED_IN-> New York City"]}
