It was the first time New England trailed during the entire postseason . On their ensuing drive , the Patriots moved the ball to the Eagles four - yard line , mainly on plays by running back Corey Dillon , who caught two screen passes for 29 yards and rushed for 25 . But quarterback Tom Brady fumbled the ball on a fake handoff Play - action pass and Philadelphia defender Darwin Walker recovered it . However , the Eagles could not take advantage of the turnover and had to punt after 3 plays . Eagles punter Dirk Johnson 's punt went just 29 yards , giving the Patriots the ball at Philadelphia 's 37 - yard line . The Patriots then drove 37 yards to score on Brady 's 4 - yard pass to receiver David Givens with 1 : 10 remaining in the period , tying the game 7 -- 7 by halftime . It was only the second halftime tie in Super Bowl history and the first time both of the game 's first two quarters ended tied .","entities":["Philadelphia Eagles","Tom Brady","Corey Dillon","Darwin Walker","Dirk Johnson","David Givens","Super Bowl XXXIX","New England Patriots"],"facts":["Philadelphia Eagles -LOCATED_IN-> Franklin Field","Philadelphia Eagles -LOCATED_IN-> Pennsylvania","Philadelphia Eagles -LOCATED_IN-> Philadelphia","Philadelphia Eagles -PART_OF-> Phil-Pitt Eagles","Philadelphia Eagles -LOCATED_IN-> Lincoln Financial Field"]}
