The Nightmare Before Christmas was reissued by Disney under the Walt Disney Pictures banner and re-released on October 20 , 2006 , with conversion to Disney Digital 3 - D. Industrial Light & Magic assisted in the process . The film subsequently received annually releases in October 2007 and 2008 . The El Capitan Theatre in Hollywood , California has been showing the film in 4 - D screenings annually in October , ending on Halloween , since 2010 . The reissues have led to a reemergence of 3 - D films and advances in RealD Cinema . Home media ( edit ) With years of successful home video sales , Nightmare subsequently achieved the ranks of a cult film . Touchstone Home Video first released the film on VHS on September 30 , 1994 , and on DVD on December 2 , 1997 . The DVD release contained no special features . Nightmare was released a second time on October 3 , 2000 as a special edition .","entities":["VHS","Halloween","Hollywood","DVD","Walt Disney Pictures","Disney","Disney Digital 3-D","The Nightmare Before Christmas re-release","Touchstone Home Video","El Capitan Theatre","4-D","3-D films","RealD Cinema","The Nightmare Before Christmas VHS release","The Nightmare Before Christmas DVD release"],"facts":["Video release -RELATED_TO-> VHS","Home Alone 2 VHS and Laserdisc release -RELATED_TO-> VHS","Home Alone 2 VHS re-release -RELATED_TO-> VHS","VHS and Laserdisc release -RELATED_TO-> VHS","Halloween -LOCATED_IN-> United States"]}
