[Ea55469] {"title":"Josh Stewart","text":"Josh Stewart
He was a company member of the 13th Street Repertory Theatre . He continued his theater in Los Angeles , performing in Light Bulb and Beacon alongside Robert Forster and Brooke Shields . Stewart appeared as an extra in The WB series Dawson 's Creek episode `` To Green , With Love '' . In 2003 he filmed a pilot for a Western for ABC entitled Then Came Jones . In the pilot he played the character of Bill Jenkins . Stewart later appeared as Sean Cleary the CSI episode `` Bad to the Bone '' , which aired on April 1 , 2004 . That same year , he also appeared in a commercial for Levi 's 501 Original jeans . Stewart currently has a recurring role in Criminal Minds as Detective William LaMontagne , Jr. , SSA Jennifer `` JJ '' Jareau 's boyfriend and later , husband . Starring television roles ( edit ) Stewart got his break when he was cast as Brendan Finney in the final season of the NBC series Third Watch . As Finney , he played the son of IAB captain Cathal `` CT '' Finney .","entities":["NBC","Third Watch","13th Street Repertory Theatre","Light Bulb","Beacon","Robert Forster","The WB","Dawson's Creek","To Green, With Love","Then Came Jones","Bill Jenkins","Levi's 501 Original jeans","Detective William LaMontagne, Jr.","Brendan Finney","Cathal Finney"],"facts":["NBC -LOCATED_IN-> New York","NBC -LOCATED_IN-> 30 Rockefeller Plaza","NBC -PART_OF-> Defunct networks","NBC bureau -PART_OF-> NBC","NBC -LOCATED_IN-> United States"]}
[Eb90a0a] {"title":"Krysten Ritter","text":"Krysten Ritter
Ritter told Philadelphia Style that she felt her `` outgoing and bubbly and funny '' personality as a performer helped her transition into acting naturally by letting her entertain the casting people . She won several bit film roles starting in 2001 , and then played a 1950s art history student in Julia Roberts ' Mona Lisa Smile ( 2003 ) . In 2006 , she appeared in All This Intimacy , a two - act , Off - Broadway play by Rajiv Joseph , at the Second Stage Theatre . Ritter signed on to star in the premiere of Zach Braff 's play , All New People , at Second Stage Theatre . Anna Camp , David Wilson Barnes and Justin Bartha co-starred in the production under the direction of Peter DuBois . Ritter had a number of guest starring roles on television , and appeared on the second season of Veronica Mars , playing Gia Goodman , the daughter of mayor Woody Goodman ( Steve Guttenberg ) . Ritter guest - starred on Gilmore Girls for eight episodes from 2006 to 2007 as Rory Gilmore 's friend , Lucy .","entities":["Lucy","Veronica Mars","Philadelphia Style","Julia Roberts","Mona Lisa Smile","All This Intimacy","Rajiv Joseph","Second Stage Theatre","Zach Braff","All New People","Anna Camp","David Wilson Barnes","Justin Bartha","Peter DuBois","Gia Goodman"],"facts":["Lucy -LOCATED_IN-> Seattle","Lucy -LOCATED_IN-> apartment","Lucy -RELATED_TO-> Henry","Lucy -RELATED_TO-> Asuka","Lucy -LOCATED_IN-> infirmary"]}

