Beginning in 2013 , the CHP switched to the Ford Explorer - based Ford Police Interceptor Utility fleet vehicles because the Ford Crown Victoria Police Interceptor was being phased out of production . CHP officers are responsible for investigating and disposing of car accidents , disabled vehicles , debris , and other impediments to the free flow of traffic . They are often the first responders at the scene of an accident ( or obstruction ) , and in turn summon paramedics , firefighters , tow truck drivers or Caltrans personnel . The CHP files traffic collision reports for state highways and within unincorporated areas . The CHP responds to and investigates all accidents involving school buses throughout the state including incorporated cities . CHP also has Multidisciplinary Accident Investigation Teams ( MAIT ) for the investigation of traffic collisions . Special responsibilities ( edit ) The CHP also publishes data on traffic accidents in California from a database called SWITRS ( Statewide Integrated Traffic Records System ) . Members of the CHP SWAT Team After the September 11 , 2001 attacks the CHP became responsible for securing and patrolling a number of potential terrorist targets in California .","entities":["California","Ford Police Interceptor Utility fleet vehicles","Ford Explorer","Ford Crown Victoria Police Interceptor","CHP SWAT Team","Multidisciplinary Accident Investigation Teams","SWITRS","traffic collision reports","Caltrans","September 11, 2001 attacks","California Highway Patrol"],"facts":["California -LOCATED_IN-> United States","California -LOCATED_IN-> US","California -LOCATED_IN-> United States of America","California -LOCATED_IN-> California's rules governing professional attorney conduct","California -LOCATED_IN-> Missouri"]}

