32,174 ) Demographics Population 139,407 ( 2008 ) Pop . density 24.53 / km ( 63.53 / sq mi ) Ethnic groups Scottish ( 38.0 % ) , English ( 28.7 % ) , Irish ( 27.9 % ) , French ( 21.3 % ) , German ( 4.0 % ) , and Dutch ( 3.1 % ) Prince Edward Island 's geography is mostly pastoral with red soil , white sand , and scattered communities . Known as the `` Garden of the Gulf '' , the island is located in the Gulf of Saint Lawrence north of Nova Scotia and east of New Brunswick , with which it forms the Northumberland Strait . PEI consists of the capital city Charlottetown , as well as urban towns Cornwall and Stratford and a developing urban fringe . A smaller urban area surrounds Summerside Harbor , situated on the southern shore 40 kilometers west of Charlottetown Harbor , and consists primarily of the city of Summerside . As with all natural harbors on the island , Charlottetown and Summerside harbors are created by rias .","entities":["Cornwall","Stratford","New Brunswick","Charlottetown","Gulf of Saint Lawrence","Prince Edward Island","Northumberland Strait","Summerside","Summerside Harbor","Charlottetown Harbor","rias","Nova Scotia"],"facts":["Poldhu Wireless Station -LOCATED_IN-> Cornwall","tin mining areas -LOCATED_IN-> Cornwall","Harrowbarrow -LOCATED_IN-> Cornwall","Carleens -LOCATED_IN-> Cornwall","Cornwall -LOCATED_IN-> England"]}
